  heading: "Margie Boulé & Friends Moving Sale"
  paragraphs:
    - "Portland's own beloved Actress, Writer, and TV Host, Ms. Margie is Moving! Long-time gal pals Margie Boulé & Gwyneth Gamble Booth are downsizing their estates, along with an unveiled collection from Gary Germer's VAULT. No room in the new home for all the great Furniture, Books, Artwork, Men's and Women's Designer Clothing/Shoes/Accessories, Decor, Toys and more. We are taking this time to liquidate not only things in their homes but many fine antiques and collectibles which have been in storage for years. There's so much to see in this collaboration of estates, including exquisite fine art by the likes of Charles Heaney and Jeffrey Tester to name a few. We can't wait for you to experience shopping this fabulous estate in the charming Vista neighborhood."
